    "changelog": "Initial pack. Six parts, applying in DMB/PSP and OFI variants, both effective 1 January 2023. The incident-notification window to the CBN (commonly cited as 24 hours) and the returns cadence and format are flagged in the research as unconfirmed and are seeded as draft. Every date, threshold and penalty in this pack is drawn from the phase-8 research brief and has NOT been confirmed against the regulator’s primary document. The pack ships unverified: its records are usable internally but excluded from generated regulatory submissions until a person verifies them (rule R10).",
